WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.550
Example simulation: after damage. The system begins at 20% health.

00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:07.530
The agent submits four plans for the next action.

00:00:07.530 --> 00:00:11.920
VALOR selects Restore capacity, the highest scoring plan that passes policy.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:15.750
System health rises from 20% to 50% after the simulated recovery action.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:20.000
The Command Center makes proposals, findings, and observed outcomes inspectable.
